<title>USA: TABLE-Del Webb Corp Q4 Jun3 30 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Del Webb Corp Q4 Jun3 30 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Fiscal Year Ended</p>
<p>					 June 30,	  June 30,</p>
<p>			     1997	  1996	1997	 1996</p>
<p> Revenues	     $347,968   $348,942 $1,186,262 $1,050,733</p>
<p> Earnings before item 13,319     11,945     39,686    (7,751)</p>
<p>Loss from extinguishment</p>
<p>  of debt (net of tax)    --	   --	1,285	   --</p>
<p> Net earnings (loss)  13,319     11,945     38,401    (7,751)</p>
<p> EPS: before item	 0.75	 0.67	 2.22     (0.44)</p>
<p> Extraordinary loss	 --	   --	(0.07)	  --</p>
<p> Net EPS		    0.75	 0.67	 2.15     (0.44)</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs	  17,793     17,914     17,862     17,425</p>
<p>NOTE: Fiscal 1996 earnings before the impact of a special charge were $34.5 million, or $1.96 per share. The special non-cash charge, in conjunction with the adoption of Statement of Financial Accounting Standards No. 121, resulted in a net loss of $7.8 million, or 44 cents per share.</p>
